# Commands Used

All commands were run in Ubuntu on WSL2. Dataset: ERR5743893.

## 1. Download the data

```bash
cd ~/ngs_project/data
prefetch ERR5743893 --output-directory .
```

## 2. Convert to FASTQ

```bash
fasterq-dump ERR5743893/ERR5743893.sra \
  --split-files \
  --outdir .
```

## 3. Check quality with FastQC

```bash
mkdir -p ~/ngs_project/results/QC_Reports

fastqc \
  ~/ngs_project/data/ERR5743893_1.fastq \
  ~/ngs_project/data/ERR5743893_2.fastq \
  --outdir ~/ngs_project/results/QC_Reports
```

## 4. Combine the reports with MultiQC

```bash
multiqc ~/ngs_project/results/QC_Reports \
  --outdir ~/ngs_project/results/QC_Reports \
  --filename multiqc_report.html
```

## 5. Index the reference genome

```bash
cd ~/ngs_project/reference
bwa index NC_045512.2.fasta
samtools faidx NC_045512.2.fasta
```

